Project 1: Paper Glider Flight Experiment

Project Code: AE-001

Aim: To investigate how wing design affects the flight distance and flight time of a paper glider.

Research Question: How does changing the wing design affect the performance of a paper glider?

Method: I will build paper gliders with different wing designs, conduct repeated flight trials, measure their flight distances and times, and compare the results.

Status: Experiment in progress.

